*Information for Fleet Drivers*

* A fleet driver is a driver that is employed by a fleet owner and has access to multiple vehicles through the app (you can check from Admin if a driver has multiple vehicles linked to their account);
* Some countries might have both fleet and private drivers. These guidelines apply only to Fleet Drivers;
* Due to access to different vehicles, fleet drivers can quickly change the vehicle displayed in the app.

*Ask the fleet driver whether they intend to change the vehicle or will wait for the current one to be repaired:*

* If the driver confirms that they will change vehicle, do not ask for proof of repair, the driver can be unblocked; 
* If the driver confirms that their vehicle is fit for use, ask for evidence (e.g. photos, if applicable) before unblocking; 
* If the driver confirms that they will repair the vehicle, ask them to come back to us once it has been done with proof of repair, so they can be unblocked. 
{panel}

