I would love to see a recording but on initial look it seems that this does not really need a fix and is happening because:

* User is on Home
** _We display provider data received from_ {{getHomeCategories}}
* User navigates to Provider Menu & trigger the {{getProviderDetails}} request
** _We display the same data received from_ {{getHomeCategories}}
** _Once_ {{getProviderDetails}} _finishes we start displaying new data received from_ {{getProviderDetails}}

*So basically we can’t display the updated data as the request hasn’t finished.*

This should also basically be solved by the new delivery mode rows design which is under {{should_display_fast_delivery_info_on_provider_menu_screen}} FF - in this case we only start displaying the delivery data on Provider Menu once {{getProviderDetails}} finishes so we would have the up to date surge info as well.

